WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
Planning an office fit out in Newcastle?

00:02.000 --> 00:06.000
Who is keeping the business brief, budget and next decision connected?

00:06.000 --> 00:10.000
Your Office Space provides client-side project management.

00:10.000 --> 00:13.000
The role is to help organise what the business needs,

00:13.000 --> 00:17.000
the information still missing and the decisions that need the client's approval.

00:17.000 --> 00:21.000
Before commitment, that can mean coordinating the workplace brief,

00:21.000 --> 00:24.000
premises questions and budget assumptions.

00:24.000 --> 00:28.000
During planning, Your Office Space brings client decisions together

00:28.000 --> 00:31.000
to the appointed designers, contractors and suppliers.

00:31.000 --> 00:35.000
During delivery, the agreed work can include tracking scope changes,

00:35.000 --> 00:37.000
program dependencies and handover actions.

00:37.000 --> 00:41.000
Your Office Space does not act as the builder or head contractor.

00:41.000 --> 00:45.000
The appointed contractors and specialist advisors retain their responsibilities

00:45.000 --> 00:48.000
and the management scope is agreed for the actual project.

00:48.000 --> 00:51.000
You stay in control of the significant business decisions

00:51.000 --> 00:54.000
with a clearer view of what needs attention next.

00:54.000 --> 00:57.000
Explore the free Newcastle fitout guides and checklists,

00:57.000 --> 01:00.000
then tell the Your Office Space team where your project stands.

